  "name": "Example: Identifying the Graph of a Translated Function",
  "problem": "The graph of $y=f(x)$ is shown below and the point $(0,9)$ lies on the curve. Sketch the graph of $y=f(x)-2.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218283/assets/b0c3acc57c74ced95e7387e285d9de1c629e7724fe9e111b13df209198069e8d.png)",
